WEBVTT

00:09.884 --> 00:12.137
[theme music]

00:32.657 --> 00:33.658
[panting]

00:35.410 --> 00:37.579
[suspenseful music]

00:42.042 --> 00:43.209
Oh, Dad.

00:43.293 --> 00:44.127
You…

00:44.711 --> 00:46.379
[emotional music]

00:47.422 --> 00:48.631
[On-jo sobs]

00:51.843 --> 00:52.677
[crying]

00:55.764 --> 00:56.848
Let me see you.

00:57.515 --> 00:59.142
-[zombies growling]
-[Su-hyeok] Get out!

00:59.934 --> 01:01.394
[students panting]

01:05.106 --> 01:06.483
[growling]

01:11.279 --> 01:12.489
[sniffing]

01:15.366 --> 01:16.826
[sighs in annoyance]
Damn it.

01:18.411 --> 01:19.287
Not here.

01:20.455 --> 01:21.331
Who are you?

01:21.998 --> 01:22.832
How did you get in?

01:25.502 --> 01:26.836
[Gwi-nam] I heard something.

01:29.964 --> 01:31.090
I thought it was in here.

01:33.343 --> 01:34.260
Out of my way.

01:35.261 --> 01:36.721
[door shuts]

01:39.599 --> 01:41.851
Where were you? Is it okay there?

01:41.935 --> 01:44.062
It's okay everywhere. I love it.

01:46.731 --> 01:47.857
The school is heaven.

01:49.943 --> 01:52.403
-[Gwi-nam] Later.
-Where are you going?

01:52.487 --> 01:53.696
You'll die if you go out.

01:54.531 --> 01:56.825
[Min-jae] Don't go out, asshole!
Do as I say.

01:59.869 --> 02:02.080
[tense music]

02:07.836 --> 02:08.962
Are you hungry?

02:10.046 --> 02:11.381
What?

02:12.090 --> 02:14.843
[foreboding music]

02:18.805 --> 02:19.973
You…

02:21.224 --> 02:22.392
hungry?

02:23.101 --> 02:24.185
I'm starving.

02:25.979 --> 02:26.980
[grunts]

02:28.398 --> 02:30.150
I'm full right now.

02:32.068 --> 02:33.528
So you get to live.

02:33.611 --> 02:34.737
[grunts]

02:34.821 --> 02:36.656
-[Gwi-nam] Count yourself lucky.
-[groans]

02:37.824 --> 02:39.868
-[sniffing]
-[Min-jae coughs]

02:41.536 --> 02:42.704
What is that smell?

02:42.787 --> 02:45.081
[panting, coughing]

02:47.667 --> 02:48.710
[grunts, gasps]

02:49.586 --> 02:51.004
Why do you smell like them?

02:51.588 --> 02:53.006
What? What do you smell?

02:53.506 --> 02:55.049
[grunts]
Let go of me.

02:55.967 --> 02:57.635
You were with Cheong-san, weren't you?

02:57.719 --> 02:58.928
Who's that?

02:59.512 --> 03:01.681
-Where is he?
-What are you talking about?

03:02.849 --> 03:03.933
You wanna know?

03:04.517 --> 03:06.394
-[munches]
-[screams]

03:08.313 --> 03:09.647
[So-ju] Are you okay?

03:10.523 --> 03:11.357
Are you hurt, On-jo?

03:11.441 --> 03:13.109
What took you so long?

03:13.735 --> 03:14.652
I kept waiting for you.

03:15.486 --> 03:17.322
[emotional music]

03:17.405 --> 03:18.281
[sniffles]

03:18.364 --> 03:20.366
And you kids, are you okay?

03:21.034 --> 03:22.118
[breathes heavily]

03:23.995 --> 03:25.371
Yeah.

03:25.455 --> 03:26.289
Good.

03:27.540 --> 03:28.374
[sighs]

03:31.127 --> 03:32.045
Cheong-san.

03:34.130 --> 03:35.048
Mr. Nam.

03:36.466 --> 03:38.509
[birds chirping]

03:43.598 --> 03:45.225
[breathes heavily]

03:45.308 --> 03:47.602
Okay. Are you all able to run?

03:48.478 --> 03:49.562
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

03:51.689 --> 03:52.690
[So-ju] Good.

03:53.650 --> 03:57.403
Okay. If you go straight
through the tennis courts

03:57.487 --> 04:00.240
and pass the construction site,
you'll hit the mountain.

04:00.323 --> 04:01.783
-[So-ju] If you cross the mountain…
-[zombies growling]

04:01.866 --> 04:03.243
-[So-ju] …and get to Yangdong--
-[zombies growling]

04:03.326 --> 04:04.410
Mr. Nam!

04:04.494 --> 04:05.620
[tense music]

04:05.703 --> 04:06.829
[zombie growling]

04:08.456 --> 04:09.332
Dad, no!

04:09.415 --> 04:10.333
[growling]

04:11.626 --> 04:12.627
[So-ju grunts]

04:13.127 --> 04:14.504
-[grunts]
-[bone cracks]

04:14.587 --> 04:16.047
[groans]

04:16.130 --> 04:17.298
Kids. Run!

04:17.382 --> 04:18.758
[sighs]
Shit.

04:20.635 --> 04:21.928
[zombies growling]

04:22.011 --> 04:23.805
GYMNASIUM

04:23.888 --> 04:25.098
[Hari] Hurry!

04:26.933 --> 04:28.601
[So-ju] Come on.

04:28.685 --> 04:30.311
Run! Go! Run!

04:31.604 --> 04:32.689
To the tennis courts!

04:32.772 --> 04:33.606
[zombies growling]

04:33.690 --> 04:34.691
[Dae-su] Hurry up!

04:36.025 --> 04:37.151
[all panting]

04:38.444 --> 04:40.196
[So-ju] Go! Go! Get in.

04:40.780 --> 04:41.739
Get in.

04:43.741 --> 04:44.993
-[growls]
-[shrieks]

04:46.286 --> 04:47.287
[So-ju grunts]

04:48.871 --> 04:50.456
-Get in! Get in!
-[zombie growling]

04:52.583 --> 04:54.043
-[So-ju grunts]
-[zombies growling]

04:55.920 --> 04:56.963
[So-ju] Run!

04:58.256 --> 04:59.257
Hey, hey, hey. Wait.

04:59.340 --> 05:01.009
[zombies growling]

05:01.092 --> 05:01.926
[gasps]

05:02.844 --> 05:04.345
[shrieks, groans]

05:07.557 --> 05:10.059
[Dae-su] We can't go out there.
We can't go anywhere.

05:10.143 --> 05:12.228
-[Wu-jin] What should we do, Dae-su?
-[Mi-jin] Damn it.

05:13.688 --> 05:14.605
[Wu-jin] What do we do?

05:14.689 --> 05:16.024
[zombies growling]

05:16.649 --> 05:18.318
[all panting]

05:18.401 --> 05:19.652
[metal clanks]

05:19.736 --> 05:21.029
-[Dae-su] Oh, shit!
-[On-jo] What now?

05:22.071 --> 05:23.114
[zombies growling]

05:25.450 --> 05:27.618
[tense music continues]

05:27.702 --> 05:29.037
[growling]

05:30.330 --> 05:32.874
-[grunting]
-[zombies growling]

05:33.583 --> 05:34.876
[Cheong-san and Su-hyeok grunting]

05:34.959 --> 05:37.295
[tense music]

05:40.631 --> 05:41.758
[fire whooshes]

05:53.853 --> 05:54.771
[Su-hyeok] Step back.

05:55.772 --> 05:56.731
Let's go.

06:00.234 --> 06:01.069
[Hyo-ryeong] Hurry.

06:03.654 --> 06:04.572
Hurry.

06:04.655 --> 06:05.656
[zombies growling]

06:07.075 --> 06:08.242
Cheong-san…

06:08.326 --> 06:09.368
Take On-jo with you.

06:09.452 --> 06:10.620
But why?

06:11.329 --> 06:12.371
Dad, where are you going?

06:12.455 --> 06:13.498
Dad. Dad!

06:14.082 --> 06:15.500
-[So-ju blows whistle]
-Dad!

06:16.167 --> 06:17.168
[blows whistle]

06:17.251 --> 06:18.461
[zombie growling]

06:18.544 --> 06:19.545
Dad, no!

06:23.674 --> 06:24.509
Dad, come back!

06:24.592 --> 06:25.885
[tense music continues]

06:25.968 --> 06:27.136
[fire whooshes]

06:27.220 --> 06:28.554
[growling]

06:32.892 --> 06:33.851
[hissing]

06:35.019 --> 06:35.937
Dad, come back!

06:37.105 --> 06:38.231
Run!

06:40.817 --> 06:42.652
Get out! Get out now!

06:43.611 --> 06:44.529
Get out!

06:44.612 --> 06:45.655
[growling]

06:45.738 --> 06:47.156
-[grunts]
-[growls]

06:49.951 --> 06:50.785
[groans]

06:50.868 --> 06:51.828
[Cheong-san] Mr. Nam!

06:54.205 --> 06:55.998
Go. Go! Get out!

06:56.082 --> 06:57.375
[Ha-ri] Hurry. Go.

06:59.210 --> 07:00.294
[metal clanks]

07:00.378 --> 07:01.420
[emotive music]

07:04.173 --> 07:05.091
Why are you?

07:07.510 --> 07:08.553
Dad?

07:10.346 --> 07:11.722
On-jo, look at me.

07:12.306 --> 07:13.432
-[So-ju] Go.
-[sobs]

07:15.852 --> 07:17.520
Run! Go.

07:19.021 --> 07:19.939
[growling]

07:20.648 --> 07:22.608
-Go!
-Dad.

07:23.276 --> 07:24.152
[So-ju] Go!

07:25.153 --> 07:27.113
Go!

07:27.947 --> 07:30.158
-On-jo! Go…
-[growling]

07:31.742 --> 07:32.827
Run.

07:33.369 --> 07:34.537
[munching, growling]

07:35.955 --> 07:37.915
Dad…
[whimpering]

07:38.541 --> 07:40.209
Go, On-jo!

07:40.960 --> 07:42.753
Run!
[screaming]

07:42.837 --> 07:44.297
-[zombies munching]
-[So-jo grunts]

07:46.090 --> 07:46.924
[On-jo] Dad!

07:49.343 --> 07:50.303
[groans]

07:51.554 --> 07:53.639
[somber music]

07:56.559 --> 07:58.519
-[all panting]
-[Ha-ri grunts]

07:58.603 --> 08:02.982
CONSTRUCTION NOTICE

08:03.065 --> 08:03.983
[Su-hyeok] Hurry!

08:04.066 --> 08:05.151
[zombie growling]

08:05.776 --> 08:06.861
[students panting]

08:07.695 --> 08:08.779
Stop!

08:08.863 --> 08:10.156
[Dae-su gasps]

08:10.239 --> 08:11.282
Why, why, why?

08:11.782 --> 08:13.159
[all breathing heavily]

08:15.077 --> 08:16.621
[foreboding music]

08:16.704 --> 08:17.914
[growling]

08:17.997 --> 08:20.374
-[Nam-ra] Go upstairs. Go!
-[gasps]

08:20.458 --> 08:22.001
[Dae-su] Hurry! To the second floor!

08:22.084 --> 08:24.045
-[growling]
-[Mi-jin] Hurry!

08:24.962 --> 08:26.964
[tense music]

08:27.048 --> 08:28.424
[growling]

08:36.015 --> 08:37.308
[Dae-su] Where do we go?

08:37.391 --> 08:39.435
[tense music continues]

08:40.811 --> 08:42.730
[Wu-jin] There's no way out. It's blocked.

08:42.813 --> 08:44.023
[Dae-su] There's nothing here.

08:44.106 --> 08:45.149
Go through this way!

08:47.735 --> 08:49.529
-Can we go?
-Let's go out this way.

08:50.112 --> 08:50.947
Get back.

08:56.077 --> 08:57.203
Hurry up.

08:58.788 --> 08:59.622
[grunts]

09:01.541 --> 09:03.417
Shit.
[grunts]

09:04.544 --> 09:07.755
[breathing heavily]

09:10.091 --> 09:12.593
DO YOUR WORK STEP BY STEP
HASTE CAUSES ACCIDENTS

09:12.677 --> 09:13.803
[Su-hyeok] Careful.

09:14.387 --> 09:15.429
[all panting]

09:20.893 --> 09:22.478
-Stay away from the edge.
-[gasps]

09:22.562 --> 09:23.688
Uh-huh.

09:27.858 --> 09:29.527
-Here. Come here.
-Quiet.

09:31.279 --> 09:32.697
Don't make any noise.

09:34.407 --> 09:35.616
[zombie growling]

09:35.700 --> 09:36.701
[object clatters]

09:37.326 --> 09:38.411
[growling]

09:40.246 --> 09:41.205
[snarling]

09:42.790 --> 09:43.916
[birds chirping]

09:44.000 --> 09:45.042
[breathes shakily]

09:45.126 --> 09:47.420
On-jo! Go!

09:48.379 --> 09:49.297
Dad!

09:49.839 --> 09:50.840
[growling]

09:52.425 --> 09:53.467
[breathes shakily]

09:56.512 --> 09:58.723
[dramatic music]

09:58.806 --> 10:01.475
[breathes shakily]

10:04.520 --> 10:06.355
-[On-jo whimpering]
-[grunts]

10:07.440 --> 10:08.399
[clanks]

10:09.817 --> 10:11.777
[sobbing]

10:13.070 --> 10:15.281
[growling]

10:16.657 --> 10:17.617
[zombies growling]

10:18.200 --> 10:20.328
[growling]

10:21.037 --> 10:23.956
[muffled sob]

10:26.917 --> 10:29.128
[dramatic music continues]

10:33.966 --> 10:35.426
[muffled sob]

10:36.969 --> 10:37.803
[sobs]

10:40.222 --> 10:41.182
[whimpers]

10:46.312 --> 10:47.146
[sighs]

10:48.731 --> 10:49.565
[exhales]

10:53.653 --> 10:54.612
[On-jo sobs]

10:55.112 --> 10:57.156
[emotional music]

11:02.495 --> 11:03.496
[On-jo sobs]

11:05.581 --> 11:06.457
[sniffles]

11:08.125 --> 11:09.543
-[On-jo sobs]
-It's okay.

11:11.170 --> 11:12.213
Just cry.

11:17.343 --> 11:19.178
[Byeong-chan] It's better to just die.

11:19.261 --> 11:20.471
[growls]

11:20.554 --> 11:21.389
[croaks]

11:23.224 --> 11:27.353
This virus changes
a person into a different being.

11:28.562 --> 11:30.147
The person I loved

11:31.565 --> 11:32.817
becomes a monster.

11:34.610 --> 11:36.654
You can forget someone who dies…

11:41.617 --> 11:43.869
but it's hard to forget someone
who has changed.

11:46.831 --> 11:47.915
[growls]

11:50.835 --> 11:52.169
[zombie growling]

11:52.670 --> 11:53.754
[sobs]

11:55.798 --> 11:57.299
[Byeong-chan crying]

12:00.302 --> 12:02.430
[emotive music]

12:04.598 --> 12:05.933
[growling]

12:10.187 --> 12:12.064
[zombies growling]

12:14.650 --> 12:17.111
To think that's the very last image
of the people…

12:20.072 --> 12:21.240
I loved the most.

12:23.993 --> 12:27.329
[growls, snarls]

12:27.913 --> 12:28.998
[groans]

12:29.081 --> 12:31.542
[foreboding music]

12:32.334 --> 12:33.711
[whimpering]

12:36.046 --> 12:36.881
[slurps]

12:37.631 --> 12:39.091
[groans]

12:43.554 --> 12:44.513
Remember now?

12:45.556 --> 12:49.101
I don't know anyone
named Cheong-san, you freak.

12:49.852 --> 12:55.065
Everyone went to the assembly hall,
and I got out by myself.

12:55.149 --> 12:56.567
The hall?

12:57.318 --> 12:59.320
I don't know who Cheong-san is.

12:59.403 --> 13:00.446
[gasps]

13:00.529 --> 13:06.452
We went with some juniors. That's all.
[groaning]

13:06.535 --> 13:10.039
That means the others are still there.

13:10.122 --> 13:11.540
[grunts]

13:11.624 --> 13:13.000
[breathes shakily]

13:13.959 --> 13:15.711
[Min-jae whimpering]

13:19.507 --> 13:20.716
[Gwi-nam] You're fucking brave.

13:20.799 --> 13:22.885
[foreboding music continues]

13:26.680 --> 13:27.723
You'd better run.

13:28.349 --> 13:29.600
Or I'll eat you.

13:30.601 --> 13:33.229
[tense music]

13:33.896 --> 13:35.147
[panting]

13:35.773 --> 13:36.607
[groans]

13:38.609 --> 13:39.485
[grunts]

13:40.986 --> 13:43.072
[tense music continues]

13:46.992 --> 13:48.077
[groaning]

13:55.417 --> 13:57.836
[croaks, gasps]

13:59.255 --> 14:00.089
[Min-jae snarls]

14:04.802 --> 14:07.221
I told you to run. Why didn't you listen?

14:09.098 --> 14:10.099
[birds chirping]

14:10.182 --> 14:11.308
[music fades]

14:13.477 --> 14:14.478
[blows air]

14:18.607 --> 14:19.525
[sighs]

14:19.608 --> 14:21.860
Damn it. Nothing is working out.

14:21.944 --> 14:23.279
We keep hitting dead ends.

14:23.362 --> 14:24.738
Would you just be quiet?

14:25.906 --> 14:27.449
It's your fault Joon-yeong died.

14:27.533 --> 14:29.159
Dae-su. Don't.

14:29.243 --> 14:31.537
If you hadn't bitched at him
and just shut up,

14:31.620 --> 14:33.247
he would never have jumped out there.

14:35.541 --> 14:37.751
Okay. It is my fault. Happy?

14:38.586 --> 14:39.503
Are you happy, asshole?

14:39.587 --> 14:40.921
You give it a rest too.

14:41.463 --> 14:42.464
Dae-su.

14:43.382 --> 14:46.260
What does it matter who's responsible
for someone's death?

14:46.760 --> 14:48.888
[Wu-jin] What does living
and dying even mean?

14:48.971 --> 14:50.139
I don't know.

14:51.181 --> 14:52.850
If we make it out,
will it really be living?

14:54.059 --> 14:55.811
Hey, you know our friends died.

14:57.062 --> 14:58.105
And our parents too.

14:59.940 --> 15:01.150
What's the point?

15:01.817 --> 15:02.943
[Mi-jin] Do you wanna die?

15:03.652 --> 15:04.695
Then will you die?

15:05.946 --> 15:07.323
Try being a senior.

15:08.032 --> 15:09.575
Then you'll really wanna die.

15:09.658 --> 15:11.243
Yeah, big deal, you're a senior.

15:11.327 --> 15:13.370
You try being one.
You'll see what it's like.

15:13.996 --> 15:14.955
You kids.

15:16.498 --> 15:19.877
You better survive till next year
and see what it's like being seniors.

15:21.253 --> 15:24.381
[Mi-jin] Survive until next year
and tell me which is harder,

15:24.465 --> 15:25.799
zombies or senior year.

15:26.759 --> 15:27.968
[Ha-ri] Hey.

15:30.137 --> 15:31.138
[birds chirping]

15:31.722 --> 15:32.848
Your father, he…

15:36.268 --> 15:37.937
He saved all of our lives, you know.

15:39.188 --> 15:40.356
[emotional music]

15:40.439 --> 15:41.899
I'll never forget what he did.

15:43.692 --> 15:44.610
None of us ever will.

15:44.693 --> 15:46.320
[birds chirping]

15:47.655 --> 15:49.531
If many people remembered someone,

15:50.240 --> 15:51.200
that person…

15:54.870 --> 15:56.121
is sure to go to heaven.

15:58.374 --> 15:59.875
[sniffles, sobs]
Mm-hmm.

16:04.630 --> 16:05.673
[birds chirping]

16:05.756 --> 16:07.800
[emotional music continues]

16:11.595 --> 16:12.972
Mi-jin.
[exhales]

16:13.055 --> 16:14.056
Let's go.

16:14.139 --> 16:15.099
Where? Why?

16:15.683 --> 16:18.227
Let's look for a good spot
where we can jump off.

16:18.310 --> 16:19.144
We're the oldest.

16:19.228 --> 16:20.646
Sure. Whatever.

16:20.729 --> 16:22.481
It's not like we get any respect.

16:22.564 --> 16:24.441
I'll go this way. You go that way.

16:26.819 --> 16:28.946
[sighs]
She's so cool.

16:30.656 --> 16:31.865
[grunts]

16:31.949 --> 16:33.158
I'll go.

16:33.242 --> 16:34.535
Stay down, kid.

16:34.618 --> 16:35.869
It's okay.

16:35.953 --> 16:36.996
[grunts]

16:38.831 --> 16:39.957
You little…

16:40.541 --> 16:41.417
Get away.

16:43.711 --> 16:44.670
[Su-hyeok sighs]

16:48.632 --> 16:50.551
-[zombie growling]
-Oh, shit.

16:50.634 --> 16:52.011
[exhales sharply]

16:53.220 --> 16:55.222
[wind whooshing]

16:56.098 --> 16:58.350
I hope no one steps up anymore.

16:59.893 --> 17:01.603
[somber music]

17:01.687 --> 17:03.480
Whatever ends up happening…

17:05.399 --> 17:07.818
I hope no one sacrifices themselves.

17:12.406 --> 17:14.783
It's too hard living for someone.

17:16.160 --> 17:18.328
When there's nothing
you can do for them at all.

17:20.247 --> 17:22.624
It's like you have
to live extra heart for them.

17:23.709 --> 17:24.877
It's too selfish.

17:27.171 --> 17:29.256
You can't die and…

17:30.841 --> 17:32.593
if you don't have the courage to live.

17:36.847 --> 17:37.806
Let's…

17:39.266 --> 17:40.517
talk a little later, okay?

17:42.561 --> 17:46.148
Tomorrow or the next day.
Or maybe even next week.

17:48.067 --> 17:50.694
Let's eat, take a bath
and then we can talk about it.

17:52.529 --> 17:54.281
That's what we agreed to do, right?

17:54.364 --> 17:56.492
[somber music continues]

18:06.043 --> 18:07.127
That side.

18:09.588 --> 18:10.422
What?

18:11.215 --> 18:12.591
You probably don't remember.

18:13.717 --> 18:14.635
What?

18:14.718 --> 18:15.719
Cheong-san, hold on.

18:16.428 --> 18:18.472
[reflective piano music]

18:20.682 --> 18:22.726
Is it better like this?

18:23.602 --> 18:24.728
Or like this?

18:26.730 --> 18:30.109
Look close. Like this? Or like this?

18:31.360 --> 18:32.569
That side is better.

18:33.821 --> 18:34.655
Left.

18:35.781 --> 18:37.699
What do you mean by that?

18:40.994 --> 18:42.371
I'll tell you tomorrow.

18:43.163 --> 18:44.081
[birds chirping]

18:48.794 --> 18:51.046
[foreboding music]

18:51.130 --> 18:52.881
[Wu-jin] Cheong-san.

18:52.965 --> 18:54.967
ONE HEART

18:55.759 --> 18:56.927
[sighs]

18:58.846 --> 19:00.097
[zombies growling]

19:07.062 --> 19:07.980
[Joon-yeong growling]

19:11.358 --> 19:13.652
That moron became a zombie.

19:14.153 --> 19:15.445
[growls]

19:22.411 --> 19:23.954
-[grunts]
-[growls]

19:24.788 --> 19:26.415
[croaking]

19:27.624 --> 19:29.126
[growling]

19:33.922 --> 19:35.966
[foreboding music continues]

19:39.553 --> 19:40.679
[growling]

19:44.266 --> 19:45.726
[sighs]

19:50.856 --> 19:52.858
[ominous music]

20:02.117 --> 20:03.327
[growls]

20:04.328 --> 20:06.413
[ominous music continues]

20:15.422 --> 20:17.716
-[growling]
-[low tone playing on speaker]

20:20.636 --> 20:24.139
Watch as we raised the frequency to 24kHz.

20:24.765 --> 20:27.601
-[growls]
-[high-pitched tone playing on speaker]

20:27.684 --> 20:28.727
[snarls]

20:32.606 --> 20:33.774
[bangs]

20:34.858 --> 20:36.568
-[high-pitched tone on speaker]
-[Jae-jun growling]

20:36.652 --> 20:38.111
[screaming]

20:38.612 --> 20:41.406
Based on tests
that we ran previously in Hyosan,

20:41.490 --> 20:43.742
they respond most at 24kHz.

20:44.243 --> 20:46.995
-[growls]
-[high-pitched tone playing on speaker]

20:50.207 --> 20:52.209
[suspenseful action music]

20:53.210 --> 20:54.795
[military advisor]
Let's begin the briefing.

20:55.295 --> 20:57.714
We plan to emit sounds using drones

20:57.798 --> 21:00.050
to lure the infected
into target locations.

21:00.133 --> 21:02.469
[military advisor] This will allow us
to maximize the resulting impact

21:02.552 --> 21:04.054
with minimal explosion.

21:04.137 --> 21:05.222
The targets…

21:05.847 --> 21:08.225
Hyosan Intersection, the sports complex,

21:08.308 --> 21:11.186
Hyosan High, Hyosan Future College.

21:11.270 --> 21:12.688
A total of four.

21:12.771 --> 21:14.147
Expected damage.

21:14.231 --> 21:18.819
Out of 170,000 residents,
110 are in various quarantine camps.

21:18.902 --> 21:20.988
Sixty thousand casualties estimated.

21:21.071 --> 21:24.032
[chief of staff] Among them,
we estimate 50,000 are infected

21:24.116 --> 21:26.535
and 10,000 are uninfected or asymptomatic.

21:26.618 --> 21:30.414
We'll send soldiers after the explosion
to evacuate whoever is left.

21:30.497 --> 21:34.710
Play the evacuation warning nonstop
until the explosions are detonated.

21:34.793 --> 21:36.628
[Nam-ra breathes heavily]

21:40.299 --> 21:41.258
[gasps]

21:43.635 --> 21:44.761
[whimpering]

21:44.845 --> 21:46.972
[ominous music]

21:47.055 --> 21:48.265
[groaning]

21:49.599 --> 21:51.476
[grunts, breathes heavily]

22:00.485 --> 22:01.445
[Nam-ra] Eat him.

22:06.992 --> 22:08.869
It's okay. Eat him.

22:11.288 --> 22:13.081
[raspy breathing]

22:13.165 --> 22:13.999
I'm hungry.

22:18.545 --> 22:20.005
[panting]

22:21.381 --> 22:22.758
-[swallows]
-[Nam-ra] I'm hungry.

22:26.053 --> 22:27.137
[gasps]

22:28.847 --> 22:31.641
[munching, muffled grunting]

22:36.188 --> 22:37.606
[Nam-ra whimpering]

22:39.524 --> 22:41.109
[breathes heavily]

22:41.693 --> 22:42.986
[Nam-ra whimpering]

22:43.070 --> 22:45.072
[foreboding music]

22:49.409 --> 22:50.410
It's okay.

22:51.620 --> 22:53.747
[sobbing]
It's not okay.

22:53.830 --> 22:55.082
Yes, it is.

22:56.833 --> 22:57.834
If it happens again,

22:58.960 --> 22:59.961
bite me instead.

23:00.045 --> 23:01.463
[emotive music]

23:01.546 --> 23:02.464
[gasping]

23:04.049 --> 23:07.677
-If you bite me, I'll end up like you.
-[crying]

23:14.893 --> 23:17.145
[breathes heavily]

23:19.272 --> 23:20.148
[metal clanks]

23:23.068 --> 23:25.070
[suspenseful music]

23:26.363 --> 23:29.366
[Wu-jin] I really think that
that's the only way out.

23:30.200 --> 23:33.537
No. It drops into
the basement on that side,

23:33.620 --> 23:35.539
and there are exposed steel bars.

23:35.622 --> 23:37.290
No way we can jump.

23:37.374 --> 23:40.669
That side faces the school,
so there's no point trying it.

23:40.752 --> 23:44.256
The ground is filled with zombies,
we'll die if we go down.

23:44.339 --> 23:47.050
There's a door on the first floor
that leads to the mountain.

23:47.134 --> 23:48.760
We have to go that way.

23:48.844 --> 23:51.263
But it's full of zombies in there.

23:52.389 --> 23:54.099
[birds chirping]

23:57.644 --> 24:00.564
Can't we reach the roof
if we use that and the windows?

24:01.690 --> 24:05.193
If someone goes to the roof and screams,
the zombies will follow them.

24:05.277 --> 24:08.572
Then I'm pretty sure it'll empty out
in there, and the rest can escape.

24:08.655 --> 24:09.739
I think it can work.

24:09.823 --> 24:10.782
No.

24:12.242 --> 24:14.286
-If that's the only way--
-I said no.

24:14.870 --> 24:16.872
Please stop sacrificing yourselves.

24:17.622 --> 24:18.832
Yeah, I agree with you.

24:19.583 --> 24:21.751
[Hyo-ryeong]
We said we'd all survive together.

24:22.919 --> 24:24.171
Me too.

24:25.630 --> 24:26.798
I feel the same.

24:28.925 --> 24:29.968
I'm with you guys too.

24:30.051 --> 24:31.178
[sighs]

24:31.261 --> 24:32.762
Then we should just wait for now.

24:32.846 --> 24:33.972
And then what?

24:34.848 --> 24:35.849
Do you have a plan?

24:36.474 --> 24:38.935
Maybe if it rains again,
they won't be able to hear us.

24:39.019 --> 24:40.562
Who knows when it's gonna rain?

24:40.645 --> 24:41.688
[sighs, groans]

24:41.771 --> 24:44.399
Don't worry. My knees are throbbing.
It's gonna rain soon.

24:44.482 --> 24:45.358
You'll see.

24:48.153 --> 24:50.405
It's way too clear.

24:52.824 --> 24:54.326
[birds chirping]

24:54.409 --> 24:55.452
[sighs]

24:55.535 --> 24:56.453
[Nam-ra] Hear that?

24:59.080 --> 25:00.290
What?

25:02.000 --> 25:03.627
They're saying to take cover.

25:03.710 --> 25:05.045
[foreboding music]

25:05.128 --> 25:05.962
Who is?

25:06.713 --> 25:08.340
[pilot] This is a public announcement.

25:08.423 --> 25:11.343
Explosives will be detonated
at the sports complex,

25:11.426 --> 25:14.512
Hyosan High School, Future College,
and Hyosan Intersection.

25:14.596 --> 25:17.807
If you hear this, take shelter
in subways and underground garages.

25:17.891 --> 25:19.976
We need to take cover.
There will be explosions.

25:20.060 --> 25:21.728
What do you mean explosions?

25:21.811 --> 25:23.021
Are you sure about that?

25:26.316 --> 25:28.652
[Nam-ra] Hyosan Intersection,
Future College…

25:29.444 --> 25:30.695
[gasps]

25:30.779 --> 25:32.530
…and also our school will be blown up.

25:33.198 --> 25:36.868
Hey, are those fucking soldiers
gonna shoot missiles at us?

25:36.952 --> 25:38.119
When is it gonna happen?

25:38.203 --> 25:39.412
I can't really tell.

25:39.496 --> 25:41.414
They're just saying to evacuate right now.

25:41.498 --> 25:43.708
Shit. Where are they expect us to go, huh?

25:43.792 --> 25:46.211
When are they gonna bomb
this whole place, huh?

25:47.837 --> 25:49.047
[Seon-moo] Initiate operation.

25:49.547 --> 25:50.715
[beeps]

25:50.799 --> 25:51.883
[door whirring]

25:55.220 --> 25:57.222
[beeping]

25:57.305 --> 25:59.557
[drones whirring]

26:05.230 --> 26:06.439
[drones whirring]

26:08.525 --> 26:09.693
Activate the sound.

26:12.028 --> 26:14.489
-[beeps]
-[high-pitched tone from drones]

26:20.829 --> 26:21.746
[drone swooshes]

26:26.334 --> 26:28.545
[drone swooshing]

26:33.633 --> 26:34.759
Send in all the drones.

26:34.843 --> 26:36.303
[whooshes]

26:41.224 --> 26:42.726
-[growling]
-[drone swooshes]

26:46.313 --> 26:47.314
[drone swooshes]

26:50.942 --> 26:51.943
[growling]

26:56.239 --> 26:57.157
[drone swooshes]

26:57.240 --> 26:59.326
[tense music]

27:00.994 --> 27:02.287
-[window glass shatters]
-[growls]

27:02.787 --> 27:04.456
[high-pitched tone]

27:05.498 --> 27:06.708
[drones hovering]

27:09.377 --> 27:11.504
[drone hisses, swooshes]

27:17.093 --> 27:20.930
CHEONGSAN CHICKEN
CHICKEN AND BEER

27:23.391 --> 27:24.517
[growls]

27:24.601 --> 27:25.602
[snarls]

27:26.144 --> 27:27.896
Won't we all die if we just stay here?

27:29.105 --> 27:30.648
Do they say where to flee to?

27:31.816 --> 27:33.568
They say that we should hide underground.

27:34.069 --> 27:35.278
[sighs]

27:35.362 --> 27:37.364
What if they drop a nuclear bomb?

27:37.447 --> 27:40.033
Korea doesn't have nukes.
What are you saying?

27:40.116 --> 27:41.493
-Huh?
-Whatever.

27:42.577 --> 27:44.496
They're gonna blow up our school.

27:44.579 --> 27:47.749
Where are we supposed to take cover?
There's nowhere to hide.

27:50.126 --> 27:51.586
[Gwi-nam screams]
Cheong-san!

27:52.629 --> 27:53.630
[Hyo-ryeong] What?

27:56.841 --> 27:57.675
[metal clanks]

27:58.343 --> 27:59.344
It's Gwi-nam.

27:59.427 --> 28:01.221
That asshole never dies.

28:01.721 --> 28:02.764
Who's that?

28:04.224 --> 28:05.809
Maybe we heard wrong?

28:06.518 --> 28:07.477
It's quiet now.

28:10.563 --> 28:12.774
[suspenseful music]

28:15.026 --> 28:17.320
[ominous music]

28:19.114 --> 28:20.407
-Here you are.
-[gasps]

28:20.490 --> 28:21.699
-[Mi-jin] What the hell?
-Cheong-san!

28:21.783 --> 28:23.076
[Cheong-san grunts]

28:24.452 --> 28:25.578
[groans]

28:27.163 --> 28:28.748
[groans]

28:29.582 --> 28:30.750
[grunts]

28:31.668 --> 28:32.877
Cheong-san! No!

28:32.961 --> 28:34.337
[Mi-jin grunting]

28:35.505 --> 28:36.881
-[On-jo] Cheong-san!
-[grunting]

28:36.965 --> 28:38.591
[drones swooshing]

28:41.511 --> 28:43.471
-[growling]
-[drone swooshing]

28:45.265 --> 28:46.307
[window glass shattering]

28:47.517 --> 28:48.643
[growling]

28:49.185 --> 28:50.562
[drones swooshing]

28:50.645 --> 28:53.273
-[growling]
-[high-pitched tone from drone]

28:56.651 --> 28:58.445
-[growling]
-[high-pitched tone from drone]

28:58.528 --> 29:00.530
-[high-pitched tone from drone]
-[growling]

29:02.824 --> 29:04.075
[growling]

29:07.829 --> 29:10.457
-[high-pitched tone from drone]
-[growling]

29:13.376 --> 29:14.502
[growling]

29:16.087 --> 29:17.839
-[high-pitched tone from drone]
-[growling]

29:21.760 --> 29:24.721
[drones swooshing]

29:25.722 --> 29:26.973
-[grunting]
-[Mi-jin] No.

29:27.766 --> 29:28.933
[groaning]

29:31.478 --> 29:32.479
[On-jo] Cheong-san!

29:34.022 --> 29:34.939
[gasps]

29:36.191 --> 29:37.525
[Cheong-san grunting]

29:39.486 --> 29:40.820
[Mi-jin] Help! Hurry!

29:41.821 --> 29:43.406
Come on. Shit.

29:44.491 --> 29:45.325
[grunts]

29:49.370 --> 29:51.664
[Cheong-san grunting]

29:51.748 --> 29:52.749
-[munches]
-[Cheong-san screams]

29:52.832 --> 29:54.542
-Cheong-san!
-Don't!

29:54.626 --> 29:56.711
-[screaming]
-[Gwi-nam munching]

29:58.213 --> 29:59.297
[Cheong-san screams]

30:03.593 --> 30:04.761
[grunts]

30:04.844 --> 30:06.513
[whimpers]

30:08.598 --> 30:10.183
-[high-pitched tone]
-[Gwi-nam grunting]

30:11.434 --> 30:13.728
[high-pitched tone from drone]

30:15.396 --> 30:16.898
-[high-pitched tone from drone]
-[groaning]

30:17.857 --> 30:19.317
[groaning]

30:19.400 --> 30:20.693
[high-pitched tone from drone]

30:24.113 --> 30:25.323
-[grunts]
-[metal clanks]

30:27.450 --> 30:28.326
[thuds]

30:32.205 --> 30:34.123
Sir, they've all arrived at the targets.

30:34.207 --> 30:35.291
Execute.

30:35.375 --> 30:37.335
Let me confirm the order, sir.

30:38.211 --> 30:39.420
Fire now!

30:39.504 --> 30:41.506
[tense music]

30:43.383 --> 30:44.509
[breathes heavily]

30:45.134 --> 30:45.969
[squelches]

30:48.096 --> 30:50.306
[somber music]

30:55.353 --> 30:56.312
It's okay.

30:56.980 --> 30:58.815
It's not what you think. It's okay.

31:01.484 --> 31:02.360
Do you hear me?

31:02.902 --> 31:03.903
Don't do it.

31:04.529 --> 31:05.822
[On-jo] You're going to be fine.

31:06.531 --> 31:07.365
On-jo.

31:09.492 --> 31:10.618
No one's dying.

31:13.037 --> 31:14.205
Not here. Not today.

31:15.248 --> 31:16.207
I just…

31:17.292 --> 31:18.668
Just don't say anything.

31:20.128 --> 31:22.255
Let's talk tomorrow, okay? Mm-hmm?

31:25.633 --> 31:27.594
[sobbing]

31:27.677 --> 31:29.429
[sniffles]

31:33.558 --> 31:35.768
[emotional music]

31:42.066 --> 31:46.154
LEE CHEONG-SAN

31:48.448 --> 31:49.949
You hold on to it for me.

31:54.162 --> 31:56.247
And I'll hold onto this.
[sobs]

31:56.331 --> 31:59.083
LEE CHEONG-SAN, NAM ON-JO

32:00.126 --> 32:02.045
[sobbing]

32:04.339 --> 32:06.215
[birds chirping]

32:13.806 --> 32:15.934
[emotional music continues]

32:19.187 --> 32:20.730
[On-jo whimpering]

32:27.236 --> 32:29.322
[emotional music building]

32:51.886 --> 32:54.138
Su-hyeok, go to the first floor.

32:55.974 --> 32:57.183
Cheong-san!

32:57.266 --> 32:58.685
[foreboding music]

32:58.768 --> 32:59.852
Hey!

33:01.229 --> 33:02.230
All of you.

33:03.606 --> 33:04.899
[screaming]
Come after to me!

33:06.192 --> 33:07.568
Today I am…

33:07.652 --> 33:08.653
[zombies growling]

33:08.736 --> 33:11.572
…the happiest guy in this school!

33:12.240 --> 33:13.574
[zombies growling]

33:15.535 --> 33:16.786
-[grunts]
-[growling]

33:17.912 --> 33:18.746
Hey!

33:19.872 --> 33:21.040
Hey!

33:21.124 --> 33:22.458
[growling]

33:26.546 --> 33:28.297
Come on, everyone. This is it.

33:29.173 --> 33:30.216
We have to go.

33:31.092 --> 33:32.468
Nam-ra, let's go.

33:32.552 --> 33:33.928
-[whimpering]
-Come on.

33:38.266 --> 33:39.434
Can you climb up?

33:43.021 --> 33:44.897
Okay. Come down.

33:45.857 --> 33:46.691
Hurry.

33:46.774 --> 33:48.651
-[zombies growling]
-[Cheong-san screaming] Hey!

33:56.951 --> 33:58.995
-[Cheong-san screaming] Hey!
-[zombies growling]

33:59.620 --> 34:01.205
Hey!

34:02.665 --> 34:03.708
[all panting]

34:03.791 --> 34:05.668
[Cheong-san screaming]
Hey!

34:05.752 --> 34:08.337
-[Mi-jin] Hurry. Hurry, hurry.
-[Wu-jin] Let's go faster. Come on.

34:08.421 --> 34:10.339
-[zombies growling]
-[Cheong-san screaming] Hey!

34:12.717 --> 34:15.803
[screaming]

34:18.806 --> 34:20.683
CAUTION, RISK OF ACCIDENT

34:22.310 --> 34:23.644
[gasping]

34:24.687 --> 34:25.813
[groans]

34:28.858 --> 34:30.860
[grunting]

34:33.529 --> 34:35.698
[Gwi-nam grunting]

34:37.492 --> 34:38.618
[Gwi-nam screaming]

34:41.370 --> 34:43.915
[Cheong-san panting]

34:44.582 --> 34:46.250
[zombies growling]

34:48.336 --> 34:49.712
[suspenseful music]

34:49.796 --> 34:50.630
[metal clanks]

34:52.298 --> 34:53.341
-[growls]
-[grunts]

34:57.345 --> 34:58.513
[groans]

34:59.889 --> 35:01.265
[zombies growling]

35:03.309 --> 35:04.519
[grunts]

35:06.896 --> 35:08.439
[growling]

35:10.817 --> 35:12.443
[metal clanking]

35:16.114 --> 35:17.532
Come at me now.

35:17.615 --> 35:19.826
[screaming]
All of you!

35:19.909 --> 35:21.244
[growling]

35:25.081 --> 35:26.499
[all panting]

35:28.584 --> 35:30.670
[tense music]

35:40.638 --> 35:41.514
[raspy breathing]

35:45.101 --> 35:45.977
[exhales sharply]

35:47.019 --> 35:48.146
[sniffs]

35:49.063 --> 35:52.024
WARNING: NO TRESPASSING
PRIVATE PROPERTY OWNED BY THE SCHOOL

35:52.108 --> 35:53.401
[all panting]

35:54.485 --> 35:55.987
[Su-hyeok] Come on, come on.

35:56.612 --> 35:57.822
[Mi-jin] Go, go, go.

36:03.744 --> 36:05.705
[metal clanks]

36:05.788 --> 36:07.832
[groans, pants]

36:14.046 --> 36:15.798
[foreboding music]

36:15.882 --> 36:17.008
[Gwi-nam breathes deeply]

36:19.594 --> 36:20.845
[Gwi-nam raspy breathing]

36:26.559 --> 36:27.602
[Gwi-nam] You know,

36:28.102 --> 36:31.063
I thought it was gonna be super fun
to kill you.

36:31.147 --> 36:32.148
[laughs]

36:33.691 --> 36:34.859
But not anymore.

36:35.526 --> 36:37.778
I'll kill you even if it isn't fun.

36:37.862 --> 36:39.530
Stop acting tough.

36:40.656 --> 36:42.867
[Cheong-san]
What do you think? You look cool?

36:43.618 --> 36:45.244
Nobody thinks that way.

36:47.830 --> 36:49.665
You're just scared
because you'll get caught

36:49.749 --> 36:51.292
for killing the principal.

36:51.375 --> 36:52.627
[Gwi-nam breathes heavily]

36:53.377 --> 36:55.880
You're still a coward and a loser.

36:57.632 --> 36:59.842
[dramatic music]

37:02.178 --> 37:03.262
[metal clanks]

37:03.846 --> 37:05.056
[sighs]

37:05.139 --> 37:07.225
[dramatic music continues]

37:09.310 --> 37:10.811
I have nothing to fear.

37:14.357 --> 37:15.733
I'm not scared of you, either.

37:17.485 --> 37:18.486
[foreboding music]

37:18.569 --> 37:19.779
[grunting]

37:19.862 --> 37:21.155
[metal pierces flesh]

37:21.239 --> 37:23.449
[both grunting]

37:23.532 --> 37:24.784
[shrieks]

37:27.328 --> 37:28.246
[grunts]

37:29.413 --> 37:30.539
[yelps]

37:31.332 --> 37:32.667
[both panting]

37:32.750 --> 37:33.668
[grunts]

37:37.046 --> 37:38.631
[groans, pants]

37:41.550 --> 37:42.385
[grunts]

37:45.721 --> 37:46.597
[groans]

37:47.306 --> 37:48.516
[growls]

37:49.016 --> 37:50.059
[both grunt]

37:53.104 --> 37:55.273
[tense music]

37:58.567 --> 37:59.568
[groans]

38:04.573 --> 38:06.367
[choking]

38:06.450 --> 38:09.161
[snickers]
I'll gouge out your eye.

38:09.245 --> 38:11.289
-[laughing]
-[screaming]

38:11.872 --> 38:13.874
-[Gwi-nam laughing]
-[screaming]

38:15.668 --> 38:17.586
-[laughing]
-[Cheong-san screaming]

38:20.006 --> 38:21.882
[screaming]

38:22.466 --> 38:24.593
-[smacks lips]
-[Cheong-san screaming]

38:26.137 --> 38:27.179
[smacks lips]

38:27.263 --> 38:28.723
[grunting]

38:31.183 --> 38:33.311
[whimpering]

38:36.022 --> 38:37.148
[groans]

38:38.274 --> 38:39.984
[grunts]

38:40.067 --> 38:41.527
Run away.

38:42.153 --> 38:43.154
[laughs]

38:45.740 --> 38:48.159
[laughs]
I'll let you live if you run.

38:48.242 --> 38:50.328
[thrilling music]

38:54.582 --> 38:56.625
[suspenseful music]

38:59.670 --> 39:01.672
-[zombies growling]
-[high-pitched tone from drones]

39:02.340 --> 39:03.341
[drones swooshing]

39:03.924 --> 39:06.302
-[zombies growling]
-[high-pitched tone from drones]

39:07.970 --> 39:11.349
-[dramatic music]
-The Sports complex. Bombing complete.

39:16.937 --> 39:19.523
Hyosan Intersection. Bombing complete.

39:20.024 --> 39:21.400
[drone hovering]

39:23.527 --> 39:24.362
[missile swooshes]

39:24.445 --> 39:27.156
[chief of staff]
Future College. Bombing complete.

39:28.074 --> 39:29.325
[missile swooshes]

39:29.992 --> 39:31.452
[growling]

39:35.831 --> 39:38.167
[growling]

39:40.711 --> 39:42.630
[croaks, growl]

39:45.674 --> 39:46.634
[missile swooshes]

39:48.719 --> 39:50.679
[croaking, growling]

39:50.763 --> 39:52.640
-[all gasp]
-[Dae-su] Ah, shit.

39:52.723 --> 39:54.058
[gasps]

39:55.976 --> 39:57.520
[glass shatters]

39:58.729 --> 40:01.816
[whooshing]

40:13.369 --> 40:14.495
[fire roars]

40:20.626 --> 40:22.336
[Gwi-nam whimpering]

40:23.546 --> 40:25.840
[both screams]

40:27.758 --> 40:28.843
[dramatic music playing]

40:35.266 --> 40:37.518
[all screaming]

40:39.270 --> 40:40.479
Ha-ri!

40:40.563 --> 40:41.689
[metal clanks]

40:42.606 --> 40:43.566
Are you okay?

40:44.233 --> 40:45.818
[shrieks]

40:46.944 --> 40:49.071
[trilling]

40:52.575 --> 40:54.577
[somber music]

40:54.660 --> 40:55.786
[chief of staff] Commander.

41:04.420 --> 41:07.339
Commander. Operation, complete.

41:10.217 --> 41:12.011
Sure. Okay.

41:13.262 --> 41:16.849
Send in the troops in the early morning
to take care of the rest.

41:17.475 --> 41:19.018
You're in charge now, officer.

41:20.060 --> 41:21.604
You want me to?

41:22.646 --> 41:23.939
You'll do a good job.

41:25.316 --> 41:26.400
[sighs]

41:26.484 --> 41:27.818
I need a sleep.

41:28.444 --> 41:29.945
I've been up for too long.

41:34.158 --> 41:36.410
[somber music continues]

41:47.922 --> 41:50.007
[somber music]

42:00.017 --> 42:01.268
You're here to chat?

42:09.360 --> 42:10.611
Or you came to watch?

42:13.906 --> 42:17.660
I came to tell you,
Hyosan was bombed last night.

42:20.996 --> 42:21.830
What was that?

42:22.665 --> 42:26.001
Forty percent of the population
of Hyosan has perished.

42:27.002 --> 42:27.836
[breathes shakily]

42:28.754 --> 42:29.880
You're a murderer.

42:31.173 --> 42:33.634
You should be ashamed of yourself.

42:37.930 --> 42:39.098
[Seon-moo sighs]

42:40.432 --> 42:41.600
[Seon-moo] I thought about it.

42:42.851 --> 42:43.936
Could anyone…

42:45.479 --> 42:48.107
offered comfort to the people
of Hyosan now?

42:49.942 --> 42:51.860
That is why I came to see you.

42:52.695 --> 42:55.823
Please tell the people of Hyosan…

42:57.199 --> 42:58.409
that I'm truly sorry.

43:00.828 --> 43:03.372
[somber music continues]

43:14.883 --> 43:17.219
[somber music]

43:46.415 --> 43:47.499
[cracks]

43:58.469 --> 44:00.054
JIN SEON-MOO

44:01.180 --> 44:03.265
[somber music]

44:08.270 --> 44:10.272
[clicks, whirs]

44:11.649 --> 44:14.234
[somber music continues]

44:19.198 --> 44:20.199
This morning,

44:21.742 --> 44:25.371
I watched the final video
of Lee Byeong-chan,

44:25.454 --> 44:27.748
the man who created the virus in his lab.

44:27.831 --> 44:29.124
[zombie growling]

44:30.584 --> 44:32.920
He tried to save his wife and son

44:33.003 --> 44:35.339
who had already been infected
by the virus,

44:36.340 --> 44:37.257
but he failed.

44:38.425 --> 44:40.094
What he did was his last resort.

44:46.392 --> 44:47.309
[growling]

44:48.435 --> 44:49.478
[Byeong-chan] Jin-su.

44:50.437 --> 44:51.355
[crying]

44:52.523 --> 44:53.691
Honey…

44:53.774 --> 44:54.942
[whimpering]

44:57.361 --> 44:59.279
[Byeong-chan crying]
Please stop!

44:59.363 --> 45:01.490
I respect the decision he made.

45:02.783 --> 45:03.617
[crying]

45:04.201 --> 45:07.371
Lee Byeong-chan was a father
and a husband.

45:08.622 --> 45:10.332
I'm sure he couldn't kill anyone.

45:12.251 --> 45:14.920
However, I am a soldier.

45:16.922 --> 45:17.756
So today,

45:18.507 --> 45:20.926
I ordered the bombing
of the city of Hyosan.

45:22.261 --> 45:24.263
No one else has instructed me to attack.

45:24.972 --> 45:26.682
No one ordered me to do anything.

45:27.808 --> 45:31.728
It was my decision and mine alone
as the martial law commander.

45:33.355 --> 45:36.859
I take full responsibility.

45:38.193 --> 45:40.654
[dramatic music]

45:45.075 --> 45:48.454
[breathes deeply]

45:52.833 --> 45:55.294
[dramatic music continues]

46:00.215 --> 46:03.218
WIFE

46:06.638 --> 46:07.890
[Seon-moo] Hi, it's me.

46:09.391 --> 46:10.225
Did you eat?

46:11.727 --> 46:13.312
[sighs]
Look at the time.

46:13.395 --> 46:14.980
How come you haven't eaten dinner yet?

46:16.732 --> 46:17.691
And the kids?

46:19.568 --> 46:20.402
Mm-hmm.

46:21.904 --> 46:24.364
It's not a big deal
if they miss school a few times.

46:24.448 --> 46:25.824
Better to stay healthy, right?

46:27.117 --> 46:28.494
Yeah.

46:29.203 --> 46:31.079
Well, I guess
we can just look for a tutor.

46:31.747 --> 46:32.748
Mm-hmm.

46:33.957 --> 46:35.667
It doesn't matter if it is expensive.

46:37.044 --> 46:37.878
[chuckles]

46:39.087 --> 46:41.215
Okay, well. Maybe not too expensive.

46:42.382 --> 46:43.550
Mm-hmm.

46:43.634 --> 46:44.593
[chuckles]

46:45.719 --> 46:48.222
[breathes heavily]
Well, honey.

46:50.599 --> 46:51.642
I miss you.

46:53.602 --> 46:54.603
Hmm?

46:56.522 --> 46:57.689
I'm so sorry.

47:04.530 --> 47:05.656
[breathes shakily]

47:06.865 --> 47:07.991
I love you.

47:10.118 --> 47:12.204
[somber music]

47:26.635 --> 47:27.636
[breathes shakily]

47:31.014 --> 47:32.307
[gun cocks]

47:34.935 --> 47:37.312
[suspenseful music]

47:57.416 --> 47:58.542
[gunshot]

48:01.503 --> 48:03.005
[muffled thuds]

48:05.048 --> 48:08.594
[cellphone buzzing]

48:09.428 --> 48:11.263
WIFE: I'M SORRY I YELLED AT YOU
I LOVE YOU TOO

48:11.346 --> 48:13.890
WIFE: WHEN CAN YOU COME HOME?

48:15.809 --> 48:17.894
[somber music]

48:56.058 --> 48:58.143
[somber music continues]

49:30.133 --> 49:37.140
NAM ON-JO

53:36.171 --> 53:40.759
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.
